[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2782695714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105011#issuecomment-2782695714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105011","id":2782695714,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l3JEi","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T09:32:22Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T09:41:45Z","body":"Await is not supported in callbacks, the code will just exit when you await and not update the data until later, it won't make the editor wait for the function to continue \n\nSee:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98707","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2782695714/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906593268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105011#issuecomment-2906593268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105011","id":2906593268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tPxf0","user":{"login":"lyhyl","id":3370369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzAzNjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3370369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl","html_url":"https://github.com/lyhyl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyhyl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-24T07:54:24Z","updated_at":"2025-05-24T07:55:00Z","body":"I am also try to make custom control in this way, and met the same problem.\nCurrently, I use a workaround that just ignore everything/return default value when the node is not ready.\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node2D\n\n@onready\nvar label: Label = $Text\n\n@export_multiline\nvar text: String:\n\tget:\n\t\tif not is_node_ready():\n\t\t\treturn \"\"\n\t\treturn label.text\n\tset(value):\n\t\tif not is_node_ready():\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tlabel.text = value\n\n@export\nvar text_visible_ratio: float:\n\tget:\n\t\tif not is_node_ready():\n\t\t\treturn 1.0\n\t\treturn label.visible_ratio\n\tset(value):\n\t\tif not is_node_ready():\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tlabel.visible_ratio = value\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906593268/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]